      "writtenOn": "2026-09-04T08:13:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the remaining point is the assumption about `admin` and `service`.\n\nThe purpose of this change is not only to remove the hardcoded usernames, but to make the test independent of any pre-configured users. The test requires a local user with the Administrator role; it does not require the username to be `admin` or `service`.\n\nTherefore, I believe the test name, tag, documentation, and related comments should also describe the actual requirement — a local Administrator — rather than continuing to refer to `admin` and `service`.\n\nThis is also consistent with Nandakumar\u0027s comment that these related contents should be updated when the `service` input is removed.",
